{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the modern MOBA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/82f24da237b6ff632603a9a5594efb80.poster.avif?t=1768730742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/82f24da237b6ff632603a9a5594efb80.webm?t=1768730742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/82f24da237b6ff632603a9a5594efb80.mp4?t=1768730742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use parkour movement, like wall jumps, to move around a giant arena. Combine moves to reach places that were  impossible to reach before and take advantage of verticality for unrivaled strategic depth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/81b8d412b9ba65a024bad534cb8aa9fb.poster.avif?t=1768730742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/81b8d412b9ba65a024bad534cb8aa9fb.webm?t=1768730742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/81b8d412b9ba65a024bad534cb8aa9fb.mp4?t=1768730742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as you want</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a huge arsenal of weapons with unique abilities and play-styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now you can choose between four weapons.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battleaxe</strong> \u2192 wrecking ball of the team with high aoe damage and high health </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dusack</strong> \u2192 super fast assassin with lots of burst damage and the ability to make an enemy player take 10% more damage from everyone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boltthrower</strong> \u2192 marksman that gets huge damage the longer the match goes and has a devastating AOE ultimate ability </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon</strong> <strong>Mirror</strong> \u2192 high single target healing with automatic self heal</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1656080?t=1768730742","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1656080?t=1768730742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/5a6a12783960766b49444a8ce1a4e98a931502a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768730742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/5a6a12783960766b49444a8ce1a4e98a931502a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768730742","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the modern MOBA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/82f24da237b6ff632603a9a5594efb80.poster.avif?t=1768730742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/82f24da237b6ff632603a9a5594efb80.webm?t=1768730742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/82f24da237b6ff632603a9a5594efb80.mp4?t=1768730742\" t